title: "Chancellor — governance and evaluation for long-running AI agents"
authors:
  - family-names: "Armstead"
    given-names: "Israel Lee"
version: "1.2.1"
date-released: 2026-11-03
url: "https://github.com/IAMGODIAM/chancellor"
repository-code: "https://github.com/IAMGODIAM/chancellor"
abstract: >-
  A governance-and-evaluation harness for long-running AI agents: work
  runs as a durable task graph, an independent judge model grades every
  consequential output, consequential acts stop at a human gate, and
  every decision leaves a hash-chained, offline-verifiable receipt.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - agent-governance
  - llm-evaluation
  - audit-log
  - human-in-the-loop
